  "content": "<h1>連接式蛙光體</h1><p>「連接式蛙光體」是一款資源包，為所有蛙光體變種、蘑菇燈及海燈籠添加連接紋理支援！</p><p>需求模組：Continuity\n未與 Optifine 進行相容性測試。</p><h1>遊戲截圖</h1><h2>珠光蛙光體</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/effe41c5c0698a2c83f9c228b686ef2b1536efcb.png\" alt=\"珠光蛙光體\"></p><h2>翠綠蛙光體</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b21515c11d36f16f89c0ee09fe2f1e3b533844d.png\" alt=\"翠綠蛙光體\"></p><h2>赭黃蛙光體</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e03c8528443ae796f24d570450358cf8ed57c74a.png\" alt=\"赭黃蛙光體\"></p>",
